              11                     
              12                     !          m.tiedtke         e.c.m.w.f.     7/86 modif. 12/89
              13                     !          purpose
              14                     !          -------
              15                     !          this routine does the final calculation of convective
              16                     !          fluxes in the cloud layer and in the subcloud layer
              17                     !          interface
              18                     !          ---------
              19                     !          this routine is called from *cumastr*.
              20                     !     parameter     description                                   units
              21                     !     ---------     -----------                                   -----
              22                     !     input parameters (integer):
              23                     !    *klon*         number of grid points per packet
              24                     !    *klev*         number of levels
              25                     !    *kcbot*        cloud base level
              26                     !    *kctop*        cloud top level
              27                     !    *kdtop*        top level of downdrafts
              28                     !    input parameters (logical):
              29                     !    *lndj*       land sea mask (1 for land)
              30                     !    *ldcum*        flag: .true. for convective points
              31                     !    input parameters (real):
              32                     !    *ptsphy*       time step for the physics                       s
              33                     !    *pten*         provisional environment temperature (t+1)       k
              34                     !    *pqen*         provisional environment spec. humidity (t+1)  kg/kg
              35                     !    *pqsen*        environment spec. saturation humidity (t+1)   kg/kg
              36                     !    *ptenh*        env. temperature (t+1) on half levels           k
              37                     !    *pqenh*        env. spec. humidity (t+1) on half levels      kg/kg
              38                     !    *paph*         provisional pressure on half levels            pa
              39                     !    *pap*          provisional pressure on full levels            pa
              40                     !    *pgeoh*        geopotential on half levels                   m2/s2
              41                     !    updated parameters (integer):
              42                     !    *ktype*        set to zero if ldcum=.false.
              43                     !    updated parameters (logical):
              44                     !    *lddraf*       set to .false. if ldcum=.false. or kdtop<kctop
              45                     !    updated parameters (real):
              46                     !    *pmfu*         massflux in updrafts                          kg/(m2*s)
              47                     !    *pmfd*         massflux in downdrafts                        kg/(m2*s)
              48                     !    *pmfus*        flux of dry static energy in updrafts          j/(m2*s)
              49                     !    *pmfds*        flux of dry static energy in downdrafts        j/(m2*s)
              50                     !    *pmfuq*        flux of spec. humidity in updrafts            kg/(m2*s)
              51                     !    *pmfdq*        flux of spec. humidity in downdrafts          kg/(m2*s)
              52                     !    *pmful*        flux of liquid water in updrafts              kg/(m2*s)
              53                     !    *plude*        detrained liquid water                        kg/(m3*s)
              54                     !    *pdmfup*       flux difference of precip. in updrafts        kg/(m2*s)
              55                     !    *pdmfdp*       flux difference of precip. in downdrafts      kg/(m2*s)
              56                     !    output parameters (real):
              57                     !    *pdpmel*       change in precip.-fluxes due to melting       kg/(m2*s)
              58                     !    *plglac*       flux of frozen cloud water in updrafts        kg/(m2*s)
              59                     !    *pmflxr*       convective rain flux                          kg/(m2*s)
              60                     !    *pmflxs*       convective snow flux                          kg/(m2*s)
              61                     !    *prain*        total precip. produced in conv. updrafts      kg/(m2*s)
              62                     !                   (no evaporation in downdrafts)
              63                     !          externals
              64                     !          ---------
              65                     !          none
              66                     !----------------------------------------------------------------------
              67                       USE shr_kind_mod, only: r8 => shr_kind_r8
